# React Patterns

- Functional components only, named exports
- Path alias: `@/` maps to `src/`
- Design system components live in `src/design-system/components/`
- Use `useCart()` from `@/app/CartProvider` for cart mutations
- Use `useTelegram()` from `@/app/TelegramProvider` for Telegram WebApp API
- All loading states use skeleton shimmer (`animate-pulse`), not spinners
- Empty states use centered layout with icon + message + CTA button
- Error states show `bg-red-50 text-brand-error rounded-2xl` banners
- Add `aria-label` to icon-only buttons
- Use `scrollbar-hide` class for horizontal scroll containers
- Shell: root layout uses `page-canvas`; bottom nav uses `nav-bottom-glass` (see `tokens.css`)
- Tailwind v4: colors via `@theme` in `tokens.css`, no `tailwind.config.*` file
